{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Tenna\n📺 Director of *TV Time* in the TV World; main antagonist and second-to-last boss of Chapter 3.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Spamton**\nFormer business partners and now archenemies.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Mike**\nHis employee, and probably his producer — Tenna seems to consider him his best friend, though he's only mentioned indirectly.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nHas a hidden pact with Kris, unintentionally revealed on the Sword Route of Ch.3.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Toriel**\nHe kept her secretly locked up in a gachapon capsule during Ch.3, calling her his \"ace up his sleeve\" for being the last member of the family to truly appreciate him — and expresses remorse…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Ralsei and Susie**\nHe enjoys having them as contestants on his show, and seems to feel special fondness for Susie.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**The title \"LORD OF SCREENS\" in the Prophecy**\nTenna is mentioned in the Prophecy's tapestries under the title \"LORD OF SCREENS\" — another of the few Darkners, along with the Knight, referred to by a title instead of a proper name…","x":-680,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_mike.webp","x":475,"y":-385,"width":170,"height":125},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/tenna_with_kriss_reminisces.webp","x":475,"y":92,"width":170,"height":128},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Tenna_Overworld_gif.gif","x":-85,"y":-295,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/tenna_profecy.webp","x":-625,"y":-390,"width":170,"height":130},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/tenna_spamton_enemies.png","x":-145,"y":-900,"width":310,"height":233},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Toriel_Overworld.webp","x":-130,"y":270,"width":91,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ralsei_overworld_hatless.png","x":-680,"y":10,"width":95,"height":180}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_kris_toriel","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_mike_spamton","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_susie_kris","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_lord_toriel","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}